<title>USA: Gelman Sciences Q4 net shr falls to loss.</title>
<headline>Gelman Sciences Q4 net shr falls to loss.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gelman Sciences Inc. and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			 Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>			    Fiscal Years Ended July 31,</p>
<p>		    (Dollars in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $  112,057     $  103,503</p>
<p> Cost of products sold			56,864	   50,070</p>
<p> Gross Profit				   55,193	   53,433</p>
<p>   Total					49.3 pct	51.6% pct</p>
